cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/avatar-stream"
abstract: "Progressive 3D over plain HTTP. Pack a GLB into a layered A3S stream whose first 50 KB is already a complete, skinned, spec-valid avatar, then refine it in place with byte-range requests. No custom server, no WebSocket, no new codec."
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
